@return 注销结果，包含操作状态和可能的错误信息See(root=CustomDocTag(children=[], params={}, name=MARKDOWN_FILE), name=com.m8test.util.McpUtils.registerServer, address=com.m8test.util/McpUtils/registerServer/#kotlin.Any#<ERROR CLASS> ERROR CLASS: Symbol not found for SseMcpServer/PointingToDeclaration/)

